mdkg:SA-006 a mdcore:SubstitutionAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Replace an involute spline with a parallel key where the hub must slide under torque (reverse of SA-001)"@en ;
    mdcore:analystNote "Deliberately paired with SA-001 to demonstrate that the model does not treat substitutability as symmetric. The spline replaces the key here; the key does not replace the spline. A graph that inferred the reverse edge automatically would assert something both sources contradict."@en ;
